---
import "./faq-section.css";
---

<section class="anikawa-faq-section">
  <div class="anikawa-faq-container">
    <div class="anikawa-faq-header">
      <span class="section-badge"> ❓ Frequently Asked Questions </span>

      <h2 class="section-title">Anime Questions, Answered</h2>

      <p class="section-subtitle">
        Everything you need to know about discovering, tracking, and exploring
        anime on AniKawa.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="anikawa-faq-list">
      <details class="anikawa-faq-item">
        <summary> How is AniKawa different from other anime websites? </summary>

        <p>
          AniKawa goes beyond basic anime listings by offering curated anime
          recommendations, detailed anime guides, AniKawa Notes, community
          ratings, watchlists, viewing history, and personalized discovery
          features designed specifically for anime fans.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="anikawa-faq-item">
        <summary> Can I save anime to watch later? </summary>

        <p>
          Yes. Logged-in users can create personal watchlists, track their
          viewing history, and easily return to anime they plan to watch in the
          future.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="anikawa-faq-item">
        <summary> How do I discover anime similar to my favorites? </summary>

        <p>
          Every anime page includes similar anime recommendations, related
          genres, curated collections, and editor-selected suggestions to help
          you find your next series.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="anikawa-faq-item">
        <summary> What information can I find on an anime page? </summary>

        <p>
          Along with synopsis, ratings, genres, and episode details, many anime
          pages include viewing recommendations, standout episodes, fun facts,
          trivia, community ratings, and exclusive AniKawa Notes.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="anikawa-faq-item">
        <summary> Does AniKawa regularly add new anime and episodes? </summary>

        <p>
          Yes. AniKawa is continuously updated with newly released anime,
          recently aired episodes, seasonal series, and popular fan favorites.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="anikawa-faq-item">
        <summary> Which anime genres can I explore on AniKawa? </summary>

        <p>
          You can browse Action, Romance, Fantasy, Isekai, Comedy, Drama,
          Thriller, Sci-Fi, Sports, Supernatural, Music, Shounen, and many other
          anime categories.
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
